It's a complete brand identity, not just a graphic. See exactly what's included on our [logo design service page](/services/logo-design/).

## The short answer

If you're actively trading, have a website, or are putting your business name in front of people who don't already know you — yes, a professional logo is worth it. The cost is modest, the difference is immediate, and it pays for itself every time a stranger forms an impression of your business.

